  "managementDiscussion": "In fiscal year FY2026, Tata Motors recorded revenue of \u20b96.25 lakh crore, growing 14.0% year-on-year, driven by continued momentum across Jaguar Land Rover, Commercial Vehicles. Net income stood at \u20b90.50 lakh crore with a net margin of 8.0% and a return on equity of 24.0%. Operating cash flow remained robust at \u20b90.87 lakh crore, supporting capital expenditure of \u20b90.31 lakh crore and a free cash flow of \u20b90.56 lakh crore. The company maintains a measured capital structure with net debt-to-equity of 0.24x. Management continues to invest in digital and AI capabilities, expects sustained volume-led growth and disciplined cost control, and remains committed to value-accretive capital allocation and sustainable returns for shareholders.",
